{"id":"int-8016c9996755fdc3fd7d4c5ec20ca207","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T10:49:47.253089723Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-6jk","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"stop_game now closes only what the launch state file recorded by pid and start time, and the server only when sptmod started it; scanned processes are reported, never signalled. Test suite runs against an empty process table by default. Commits 078bc9e and 099a1ac on branch fix/stop-game-scope."}}
{"id":"int-fb9bce19bb9a20dd6063c746f5205d8d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T10:49:47.834724338Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-18h","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Autouse fixture in tests/conftest.py isolates every test from the real process table; the two rpc tests no longer scan it. Commit 099a1ac on branch fix/stop-game-scope."}}
{"id":"int-1a9ab2c37dcf7e2931b0df68bf16bf5d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T10:52:41.155984091Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-b3r","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Implemented on branch feat/mod-sets (worktree spt-mod-manager-wt/modsets): commits f2b6866, 689e9b6, 14ef515 on top of the mod sets commits. Roles per game folder in config-dir fika.json; client-mode launch against a remote host; paired Fika install plan by slug; host mod set via import+apply. Not merged; client argv unverified against a live Fika session."}}
{"id":"int-1dc188c5bc6eb389f2d95bdf9762f53d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T12:08:22.463217519Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-3fz","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Merged to main in 9e4a5cd (feat/command-palette): Ctrl+K command palette, queued intents channel and arrow-key row navigation in the mod table, with component tests."}}
{"id":"int-6cbc75a685d4f186c7c68de608e03ee2","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T12:16:56.833521122Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-0t0","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Verified against the live umu session: the recorded umu-run wrapper does NOT exit during play - EscapeFromTarkov.exe runs 6 levels below it (umu-run > srt-bwrap > pv-adverb > proton > umu.exe > ... > EscapeFromTarkov.exe). _terminate already terminates the recorded process plus children(recursive=True), so Stop closes the whole Wine-hosted tree; the bug's premise (wrapper exits, game unreachable) does not reproduce. Hardened _terminate to only include descendants whose start time is >= the recorded process's, so a recycled pid can never be killed, and added tests for a deep wrapper>middle>grandchild tree and for an older descendant being left alone. Option B (watch_game recording the adopted scanned client) stays unimplemented and is only reachable if umu-run is killed externally while descendants survive; in that case stop reports an honest 'still running' rather than a false success."}}
{"id":"int-52def0918111e3eb09d0e241d16e2cca","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T12:38:39.896576009Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-bz4","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Closed"}}
