{"id":"int-eee378c5629b09d081e8e5406ba38a4d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:03.623525317Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-h9m","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed in 9ed5a02, merged to main as 46454a7. stop_game now closes the game via a recorded adopted_client ref when the umu-run wrapper dies first. Residual risk filed as spt-mod-manager-4ed."}}
{"id":"int-f0d122f01e4ae63a6345617a8aa83b83","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:53:49.34518475Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-1qt","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed in 0ab5156, merged as 33f7458. Added a second vitest config (happy-dom, frontend/tests/**) with mocked transport; 10 files / 264 tests including the profile route's stop_game message and server_stoppable gate. Coverage floor 94.19/76.68/93.91/93.17. pnpm test unchanged at 26 files/798 tests/100%. CI runs the new suite."}}
{"id":"int-78ea8f273e6b56b33a7c5a3b32ac04c4","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:53:49.926801302Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-har","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed in 673d54e. All eight modules split; schemas and launch became packages with pure re-export __init__ (119 and 22 names). max-module-lines lowered 1869 -> 1000 (pyproject.toml:85). Move-only: zero changed function bodies after rename normalisation, per-group test-name sets identical, 2157 passed unchanged, pylint 10.00/10. cli.py at the 1000 ceiling tracked as spt-mod-manager-vra."}}
{"id":"int-595843a9bb1eb77531a5d1952f5d5f03","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-09T07:52:40.953664684Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-9jj","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed in 113c69b: game_lock validates the game directory via detect_layout before opening the lock file, so all locking call sites raise the typed NotAGameDirError (RPC NOT_A_GAME_DIR, CLI exit 3) instead of leaking a raw errno as INTERNAL_ERROR. Also stopped game_lock from creating .sptmod-lock inside an unvalidated directory."}}
{"id":"int-96a99c59c1cf3fe36e9fc22d3b725f6e","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-09T07:56:19.850312478Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-soe","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed in ecc098d: stop_game and watch_game gained a public keyword-only terminate_timeout= seam defaulting to TERMINATE_TIMEOUT. Tests no longer patch psutil.wait_procs (grep in tests/ is empty); the kill path uses a stub that ignores SIGTERM, so SIGKILL escalation is deterministic."}}
{"id":"int-11061a13b4043597dc546ed954d2448e","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-09T09:00:52.563885722Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-4ed","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed in 4501626: adoption now requires the client to be a live descendant of the recorded wrapper, cross-checked by create_time against pid reuse, and the youngest matching descendant wins instead of the first in scan order. The state file records descendant_of; an unattributable note is ignored rather than acted on. Clause (b) of the report (time window + exe path) was deliberately dropped: GameProcess carries no exe path and a bare time window would re-admit the reported bug. Harness guard fixed in 7c49dd5."}}
{"id":"int-7d55efca237d233aba44a30745a187f2","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-09T09:08:58.848776938Z","actor":"Philipp Baumm","issue_id":"spt-mod-manager-vra","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed in c5f37f2 (cli.py -> src/sptmod/cli/ package, 9 modules, largest 355 lines, sptmod --help byte-identical), d6a5f11 (catalog.py -> catalog/ package: schema/rows/store) and 39562ca (max-module-lines 1000 -> 900, now set by tests/test_services_update.py with real headroom). catalog.py was split in the same run because it would otherwise have inherited the identical zero-headroom ceiling. Review fixes in 3e50119 and 6a332ac; the help order the cli module names encode is now asserted in tests/test_smoke.py."}}
